{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789941513,"nonce":"XWH2oLTIHuRmlyeqahmaJPsWC6Y=","title":"Imported generic abstracts never specialized; transitive callees took the caller's type params","message":"Three defects found through haxe.ds.Vector\u003cT\u003e (an abstract over rayzor.Vec\u003cT\u003e):\n\n1. A call on an imported generic abstract (`v.join(\"-\")` with `v:Vector\u003cInt\u003e`)\n   carried no type arguments into the MIR call: `receiver_is_generic_instance`\n   and the `call_type_args` extraction in `call/direct.rs` and the FUNCTION_MAP\n   path in `call/mod.rs` only read `TypeKind::Class { type_args }`, and the\n   abstract constructor HIR Call carried none either, so `new Vector\u003cInt\u003e(n)`\n   specialized as `new__i64` and `join` ran erased (`5-5-5` for `[5,1,3]`).\n\n2. `propagate_transitive_fixups` specialized a generic callee reached from a\n   specialized caller with the CALLER's substitution map, zipped positionally\n   against the CALLEE's own `type_params`. `Vector\u003cInt\u003e.join` calls\n   `StringBuf.add\u003cT\u003e` with a String: the callee's T became I32 and the buffer\n   appended the string pointer as an integer. The callee now gets its own map\n   from `extract_generic_call` on the call instruction, falling back to the\n   caller's map only when the call carries nothing.\n\n3. `trace([0, 7])` printed `[null, 7]`: the untyped array formatter treats a\n   zero slot as null. The trace intrinsic and the Std.string conversion now pick\n   `haxe_array_to_string_{i64,bool,f64}` from the static element type.\n\nAlso: `rewrite_call_sites` retypes the call's dest register to the instance's\nreturn type (a specialized `T` return used to keep the erased I64 type, so an\nF64 result went through fptosi), and `RAYZOR_DUMP_MIR_MONO=1` dumps the module\nafter monomorphization.\n\nRegression fixture: haxe-conformance/regressions/VectorAndAbstractCtors.hx\n(join \"5-1-3\", sort \"[1,3,5]\", Vector\u003cString\u003e.join \"z,q\").\nConformance 591 -\u003e 593, 0 LOST.","files":null}]}